{"animation":false,"id":376,"name":"Sentai Filmworks"}],"synopsis":{"language":null,"source":"anilist","spoiler":false,"text":"Illyasviel von Einzbern's life has become ridiculously complicated since the Kaleidostick Ruby convinced her to become a magical girl and join the quest for collecting the seven Class Cards. Since then, almost every day has brought a new surprise, from gaining new friends and partners like Miyu Edelfelt, to encountering her own magical twin! One would think Illya deserves a little time off, right? No such luck: a trip to the beach quickly turns into a magical quest, and Illya finds herself caught in a string of magical feuds, encounters with love potions, an excursion into the world of \"boys love\" comics (plus the women who read them), and half a dozen other delirious diversions. However, that's only the warm-up for what might be her final mission: recovering the long-lost Eighth Card!\n\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)"},"tags":[{"name":"Magic","rank":100,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cute Girls Doing Cute Things","rank":88,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":87,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Female Cast","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban Fantasy","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Butler","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Maids","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Swordplay","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Archery","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Nun","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Gods","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Henshin","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ojou-sama","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shounen","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kuudere","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Nudity","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Isekai","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Mythology","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Anthropomorphism","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tanned Skin","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Otaku Culture","rank":60,"s